# Grass loot — policy call:
# Matches classic voxel-game convention where grass blocks degrade to dirt
# when mined without a precise-break tool. A precise-break tool preserves
# the grass block. Reason it's not "always drop grass": grass is biome-
# coupled (tints from biome colormap); dropping it freely would let players
# carry biome-specific grass across climates. This keeps that coupling
# aesthetic rather than mechanical.
pool:default:
rolls: 1
entry:precise:
type: item
item: finevox:grass
count: 1
condition: precise-break
entry:normal:
type: item
item: finevox:dirt
count: 1
condition: not precise-break
